 to find the BPSC Auditor Exam Date 2026?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer.</strong>&nbsp;Look for&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"731\" data-end=\"797\">“Exam Date – BPSC Auditor Recruitment 2026”</strong>&nbsp;in the notifications list</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. What login credentials do I need to download the Exam Date?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer.&nbsp;</strong>Typically you will need your&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"1045\" data-end=\"1068\">Registration Number</strong>&nbsp;(or Roll Number)&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1093\">and</strong>&nbsp;your&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1116\">Date of Birth</strong>&nbsp;(or Password) to login.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. What is BPSC Official Website?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer. </strong>The Official Website of BPSC is https://bpsc.bihar.gov.in/</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
